  "protocol": "generic",
  "source": "Novation Launchkey [MK3] Programmer's Reference Guide v1 — DAW mode on the DAW In/Out port (enter 9F 0C 7F, leave 9F 0C 00); pots CC 21-28, faders CC 53-60 and 61 (49/61/88), Play / Stop / Record / Loop CC 115-118, Track left / right CC 102 / 103, all on channel 16; pot mode CC 9 (2 = Device) (https://fael-downloads-prod.focusrite.com/customer/prod/downloads/launchkey_mk3_programmer_s_reference_guide_v1_en.pdf)",
